replace github.com/relux-works/skill-go-testing-tools/tuitestkit => /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator/agents/skills/skill-go-testing-tools/tuitestkit

  → Implement durable exact staging-prefix progress in the canonical journal and recovery validation
  • Add subprocess regressions for shorter and longer source-valid prefix mutations plus journal validation
  • Run focused, race, vet, full build/check, portability, formatting, and diff validation
  • Attach cycle-7 outcome evidence, update board logbook/notes, and hand off to review
codex
The defect is localized: after each 32 KiB `Sync`, the journal still described only “some valid source prefix.” I’m changing that state to an exact durable byte count plus SHA-256 prefix digest, saving it before the crash hook, and making recovery accept only that exact acknowledged state. The regression will mutate the crash-created file to both shorter and longer source-valid prefixes and verify preservation plus `ErrImplementationCorruption`.
